Device data
===========

The device files this application loads are generated from the MIDI Guide
dataset, maintained by Pencil Research.

    Source:  https://github.com/pencilresearch/midi
    Website: https://midi.guide/
    Commit:  see devices/SOURCE, which records what the site was built from
